class_name MazeMammothCalf
extends MazeMammoth
## A woolly mammoth calf, in its herd (MazeMammoth.herd_of): a ball of fuzz on
## short legs, no tusks, a trunk it does not quite know what to do with. It
## keeps at its mother's side, grazing as she grazes and following her, and
## when the herd is alarmed it presses in against her, away from what alarmed
## them, while the herd closes round it. It catches nobody. To the world's life
## (Ecology) it is a kind of its own: small enough to be prey, which the herd
## does not allow.


func is_calf() -> bool:
	return true
